- Segment transverse elements into continuous lines across bridge width
- Support 2D plotting of all 9 result components: Fx, Vy, Vz, Tx, My, Mz, Dx, Dy, Dz
- Include girder position indicator lines (G1..Gn), zero baseline, and peak annotations
- Display interactive SummaryOverlay HUD with max/min values and appropriate units
- Preserve 3D rendering for longitudinal members without regressions
